- Follow **PEP 8** and **PEP 561**; black + ruff will enforce.
- Every function *must* carry type hints (`mypy --strict` passes) and a Google-style docstring.
- Use list comprehensions or vectorised numpy/pytorch ops instead of explicit loops where complexity ≤ O(n²).